title: Jazz Blues
key: F
tempo: 140
style: blues

// The twelve bars as a jazz band plays them: the quick change, a two-five
// into the four, a diminished chord climbing out of it, the three and the six
// into the two, and a two-five home that turns round by the six.
[A]
| F7  | Bb7   | F7    | Cm7 F7 |
| Bb7 | Bdim7 | F7    | Am7 D7 |
| Gm7 | C7    | F7 D7 | Gm7 C7 |
